  <section class="box" id="overview">
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Fivetran is a fully managed data integration platform that automates data pipelines from sources to destinations. Unlike infrastructure-heavy solutions like Debezium or AWS DMS, Fivetran requires zero infrastructure management—no servers, no Kafka clusters, no replication instances.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Key features:</strong>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Fully managed SaaS platform—no infrastructure to provision or maintain</li>
      <li>500+ pre-built connectors for databases, SaaS apps, files, and events</li>
      <li>Automatic schema drift detection and propagation</li>
      <li>Log-based CDC where available (MySQL binlog, Postgres WAL), polling fallback otherwise</li>
      <li>Built-in data type conversions and normalization</li>
      <li>Usage-based pricing (Monthly Active Rows - MAR)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <strong>CDC Approaches in Fivetran:</strong>
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Log-based CDC:</strong> Reads MySQL binlog or Postgres WAL for low-latency capture (~1&ndash;5 minutes depending on plan)</li>
      <li><strong>Incremental updates:</strong> Polls source using updated_at or similar column (minutes latency)</li>
      <li><strong>Full table refresh:</strong> Re-imports entire table (for sources without CDC or incremental columns)</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

